# ARCHIVED — NOT a supported deployment manifest.
#
# GEBCO production moved from Pipenv to uv in v0.5.1
# (specs/v0.5.1_migration_plan.md). The authoritative production
# dependency manifest is the root pyproject.toml + uv.lock; VM34 and
# VM37 both build their .venv with `uv sync`.
